{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-6a4a4125-c976-4fd4-9602-9fb08353ca65","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"Claude-Opus-4.8","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HesmEBHWQ1d5TSHPbJfrrR","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/data1/workspace/weihongren/kda-runs/formal-kda-20260916--sol_execbench--L2-049_group_limited_topk_routing/candidates.jsonl","old_string":"Decisive test of order with a proven-correct set. If pass -> done (then perf-tune precision/tiling/fusion). If fail -> reproduce torch.topk(sorted=False) native order.\"}","new_string":"Decisive test of order with a proven-correct set. If pass -> done (then perf-tune precision/tiling/fusion). If fail -> reproduce torch.topk(sorted=False) native order.\"}\n{\"candidate\": \"c010\", \"parent\": \"c009\", \"source_sha256\": \"249a08d53064f98e97066e36ad746aec4afb894e4fc200652bcf4a6bd90cfec2\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-18T00:50:45Z\", \"hypothesis\": \"The reference torch.topk(masked,k=8,sorted=False) CUDA gatherTopK order is: the 7 strictly-larger experts in ASCENDING INDEX, then the kth-value (min-score selected) expert LAST. Reproducing that exact emit order on the proven-correct exact-fp32 set will pass all 5.\", \"config\": {\"arch\": \"two-kernel split\", \"gemm\": {\"BLOCK_M\": 16, \"BLOCK_K\": 32, \"num_warps\": 4, \"num_stages\": 1, \"precision\": \"ieee fp32\"}, \"route\": {\"grid\": \"(T,)\", \"num_warps\": 4, \"num_stages\": 1}, \"output_order\": \"torch.topk(sorted=False): first 7 (strictly-larger) by asc index, min-score expert last (8x8 restricted rank + scatter)\", \"sigmoid\": \"1/(1+exp(-x))\", \"sentinel\": \"-1e30\"}, \"validation\": {\"static_gate_passed\": true, \"static_gate_notes\": \"exact-fp32 provably-correct set (from c009); only emit order changed vs c009; descending selection loop => pick i=TOPK-1 is the min-score/kth expert -> slot 7; picks 0..6 -> slots 0..6 by ascending expert index\"}, \"per_workload\": [{\"uuid\": \"469b2796-deb3-5a83-