s the single biggest, zero-correctness-risk speed lever. c011 = c010 with the GEMM reverted to bf16 (drop .to(fp32) upcast and input_precision='ieee'; keep everything else). Expect a large speedup toward/above 1.0x.\", \"cumulative_evals\": 10, \"skills_used\": \"none\", \"next_candidate_plan\": \"c011 (parent c010): revert gate GEMM to bf16 HMMA (remove the fp32 tile upcast and input_precision='ieee'; acc += tl.dot(a_bf16, b_bf16)), keeping c010's exact routing + torch.topk output order. Single-variable perf change; precision proven comparison-irrelevant (c007==c009). Then tile/tune GEMM (BLOCK_M/BLOCK_K/num_stages>=2/num_warps) and consider re-fusing the two kernels to cut the logits DRAM round-trip + second launch.\"}"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":204483,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":4871,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9ea0172f-0d08-4505-a532-c8d017f1ec64","uuid":"570b4b19-09ed-4720-94aa-d337c2e9bd09","timestamp":"2026-09-18T00:51:34.281Z"}
